 published.</p></div><div id="changelog" class="archive"><div class="section-title"><h3>Release archive & changelog</h3><span class="pill">Distinct versions. Preserved builds.</span></div><div v-if="!releases.length" class="archive-empty"><GitBranch/><p>No public releases are available yet. The first installer will appear here with its date, size, SHA-256 checksum and release notes.</p></div><article v-for="r in releases" :key="r.buildId" class="release-row"><div><h4>{{r.publicVersion}} <span class="pill">{{r.state}}</span></h4><p>{{r.notes}}</p><small>{{r.publishedAt?new Date(r.publishedAt).toLocaleDateString():'Unpublished'}} · {{(r.size/1048576).toFixed(1)}} MiB</small><code>{{r.sha256}}</code></div><div class="row"><button :disabled="!r.sha256" @click="copyChecksum(r)"><Check v-if="copied===r.buildId"/><Copy v-else/><span class="sr-only">Copy SHA-256</span></button><a v-if="isDownloadable(r)" :href="r.url" download="solaralauncher.exe" class="button"><Download/> {{r.publicVersion}}</a></div></article></div></section>
